Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Is the beef too far with certain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:03.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}people to totally squash?
