Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}our own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}みんな稼いでるし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}それぞれの道を行ってんだから
