Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because I don't know how anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}looks at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}周りが俺をどう見てるか
